00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:42.220
Viggo Mortensen stars as a father who is raising his kids outside of society, in the woods

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.900
They are highly intelligent, they are very skilled.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.120
